  "description": "Test build of three supports as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): Janna's Eye of the Storm and Lulu's Help, Pix! go to the nearby allied champion in danger (low health or surrounded; else the one fighting) and Sona's Aria of Perseverance heals the most wounded nearby ally, instead of a random ally (the main pack's RandomTarget). Shields, heals and pictures are the main pack's numbers. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
